Package: uk.551.no2theft.photocrashguard
Name: No2Theft Photo Crash Guard (Experimental)
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: 551UK
Author: 551UK
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0), xyz.cypwn.no2theft16 (>= 1.3.5)
Description: Experimental guard for legacy No2Theft photo capture exceptions on iOS 16.
 Catches Objective-C exceptions raised inside No2Theft's original photo
 capture routine so they may not abort SpringBoard.
 Does not replace the stable No2Theft installation or guarantee photos.
